WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Little League Ceremonial First Pitch. Silent clip.]

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Gus waddles to the mound to throw the ceremonial first pitch.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.600
Gus winds up, forgets the ball, and squawks instead.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.600
Both teams, the umpire, and the hot-dog vendor leave the field.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.000
Gus has been asked to stay in the parking lot next time.
